# BuildKit picks up "<dockerfile>.dockerignore" for this specific Dockerfile
# (buildx >= v0.33), so the repo-root build context stays lean.
#
# This image only COPYs apps/khal-ui + packages/sdk. Keep the committed
# capabilities.json (package/src/capabilities/*.json) — the pack imports it —
# and packages/sdk/src (the Vite alias source). dev/dist is rebuilt inside the
# image, so a stale local one is correctly excluded via **/dist.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
.turbo
.git
.github
.husky
data
docs
examples
plugins
deploy
apps/ui
apps/khal-ui/evidence
apps/khal-ui/.qa
**/__tests__
**/*.test.ts
**/*.spec.ts
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
*.log
.DS_Store
